함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 2016</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">년 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">8</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">월 초등학교 여름방학 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">농산어촌 초등학교에서 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">1</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">주일 간 교육활동 가능한 팀에 한함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- 3</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">인 또는 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">4</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">인 팀으로 구성</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">혼성 팀 구성 불가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">)/ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">휴학생 및 외국인 항생 포함 가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">교육재능기부 활동 시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">응모한 대학생 전원이 반드시 강사로 참여해야 함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">- </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">교육활동 참여 대학생팀은 현장이동</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">교육활동</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">관련 물품구매 및 운반조달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학생관리</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">학교와의 사전 커뮤니케이션 등 모든 사항을 직접 수행하게 되며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">재단은 학교 최초 매칭 및 활동에 필요한 예산을 지원함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">공모내용</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&lt;</span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">농산어촌 초등학생 대상 유익하고 재미있는 에듀테인먼트 기획안 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕\">수업기간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">5</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; mso-fareas